            </note>
            <note corresp="#d151-f3" n="3" xml:id="d151-f3-content">
                <p>Carter signed Presidential Directive/NSC–13, “U.S. Conventional Arms Transfer
                    Policy,” on May 13, 1977. See <ref target="frus1977-80v26#d271"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, vol. XXVI, Arms
                        Control and Nonproliferation, Document 271</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
